From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Gofman <pgofman@codeweavers.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 13:10:26 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "winegstreamer: Reduce CLSID_decodebin_parser merit,
 so the MPEG splitter is chosen instead for MPEGs."

This reverts commit e870f31d773376f3824c7803b5451f7025c3e92b.

The commit itself is not wrong but WMVideo Decoder DMO currently doesn't work with Proton transcoding.

CW-Bug-Id: #27265
(cherry picked from commit 653bf368cc69e892e56c3e588aafd318224eaf5a)
---
 dlls/winegstreamer/main.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/winegstreamer/main.c b/dlls/winegstreamer/main.c
index 374a9bf31bc..c515b79ec1b 100644
--- a/dlls/winegstreamer/main.c
+++ b/dlls/winegstreamer/main.c
@@ -1093,7 +1093,7 @@ static const REGFILTERPINS2 reg_decodebin_parser_pins[3] =
 static const REGFILTER2 reg_decodebin_parser =
 {
     .dwVersion = 2,
-    .dwMerit = MERIT_NORMAL - 1,
+    .dwMerit = MERIT_PREFERRED,
     .cPins2 = 3,
     .rgPins2 = reg_decodebin_parser_pins,
 };
